{"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Vector Tile Sources"},"abstract":[{"text":"Add and style a vector tile source","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This example uses UIKit"}]}],"type":"aside"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This example shows how a vector data source can be added and a style for it can be configured dynamically."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The tiles are ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/demotiles\/tree\/gh-pages\/tiles-omt","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" that use the OpenMapTiles schema. We are interested in the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/openmaptiles.org\/schema\/#poi","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" that are in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"poi","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" layer, and filter this further with an ","type":"text"},{"code":"NSPredicate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to only show POIs with a ","type":"text"},{"code":"class","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of shop. Each POI has a ","type":"text"},{"code":"rank","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" which is normally used to reduce label density. In this example, we use it to demonstrate how a numeric attribute can be used for styling with the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/maplibre.org\/maplibre-style-spec\/expressions\/#step","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" expression. POIs with a rank between 0 and 10 get a red color, between 10 and 20 green, etc.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["class DDSCircleLayerExample: UIViewController, MLNMapViewDelegate {","    var mapView: MLNMapView!","","    override func viewDidLoad() {","        super.viewDidLoad()","","        mapView = MLNMapView(frame: view.bounds, styleURL: AMERICANA_STYLE)","        mapView.autoresizingMask = [.flexibleWidth, .flexibleHeight]","        mapView.tintColor = .darkGray","","        \/\/ Set the map’s center coordinate and zoom level.","        let innsbruck = CLLocationCoordinate2D(latitude: 47.26497, longitude: 11.4088)","        mapView.setCenter(innsbruck, animated: false)","        mapView.zoomLevel = 14","","        mapView.delegate = self","        view.addSubview(mapView)","    }","","    \/\/ Wait until the style is loaded before modifying the map style.","    func mapView(_: MLNMapView, didFinishLoading style: MLNStyle) {","        let source = MLNVectorTileSource(identifier: \"demotiles\", configurationURL: URL(string: \"https:\/\/demotiles.maplibre.org\/tiles-omt\/tiles.json\")!)","","        style.addSource(source)","","        let layer = MLNCircleStyleLayer(identifier: \"poi-shop-style\", source: source)","","        layer.sourceLayerIdentifier = \"poi\"","        layer.predicate = NSPredicate(format: \"class == %@\", \"shop\")","","        \/\/ Style the circle layer color based on the rank","        layer.circleColor = NSExpression(mglJSONObject: [\"step\", [\"get\", \"rank\"], 0, \"red\", 10, \"green\", 20, \"blue\", 30, \"purple\", 40, \"yellow\"] as [Any])","        layer.circleRadius = NSExpression(forConstantValue: 3)","","        style.addLayer(layer)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"DDSCircleLayerExample.png"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Map data from OpenStreetMap. Style uses OpenMapTiles."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AnimatedLineExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/WebAPIDataExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/LineStyleLayerExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/POIAlongRouteExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GeoJSON","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/PMTiles","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateExample","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateVectorExample"],"anchor":"Styling-and-Dynamic-Data","title":"Styling and Dynamic Data"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/DDSCircleLayerExample","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/ddscirclelayerexample"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"kind":"article","references":{"https://openmaptiles.org/schema/#poi":{"titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"POIs"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/openmaptiles.org\/schema\/#poi","type":"link","title":"POIs","url":"https:\/\/openmaptiles.org\/schema\/#poi"},"https://github.com/maplibre/demotiles/tree/gh-pages/tiles-omt":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/demotiles\/tree\/gh-pages\/tiles-omt","type":"link","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"tiles around Innsbruck, Austria","type":"text"}],"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/demotiles\/tree\/gh-pages\/tiles-omt","title":"tiles around Innsbruck, Austria"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/FeatureStateExample":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This example demonstrates how to use feature state to create interactive maps with dynamic styling based on user interactions."}],"type":"topic","role":"article","title":"Set Feature State","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateExample","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/featurestateexample","kind":"article"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/LineStyleLayerExample":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/LineStyleLayerExample","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/linestylelayerexample","title":"Using GeoJSON with a line style layer","abstract":[{"text":"Adding an ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNLineStyleLayer","type":"reference"},{"text":" to the map using a GeoJSON file.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","role":"article"},"https://maplibre.org/maplibre-style-spec/expressions/#step":{"identifier":"https:\/\/maplibre.org\/maplibre-style-spec\/expressions\/#step","url":"https:\/\/maplibre.org\/maplibre-style-spec\/expressions\/#step","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"step","type":"text"}],"title":"step","type":"link"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/POIAlongRouteExample":{"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Use an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSPredicate"},{"type":"text","text":" to show POI and road labels along a route."}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/poialongrouteexample","role":"article","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/POIAlongRouteExample","title":"POI Along a Route"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNLineStyleLayer":{"abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNLineStyleLayer","isActive":true},{"text":" is a style layer that renders one or more stroked","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"polylines on the map.","type":"text"}],"title":"MLNLineStyleLayer","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"MLNLineStyleLayer","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnlinestylelayer","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNLineStyleLayer"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/AnimatedLineExample":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AnimatedLineExample","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/animatedlineexample","title":"Animated Line","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add an animated line to a map"}],"kind":"article","role":"article"},"DDSCircleLayerExample.png":{"identifier":"DDSCircleLayerExample.png","type":"image","alt":null,"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/org.swift.MyProject\/DDSCircleLayerExample@2x.png","traits":["2x","light"]}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/GeoJSON":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/geojson","title":"Working with GeoJSON Data","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GeoJSON","role":"article","abstract":[],"kind":"article"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/PMTiles":{"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Working with PMTiles"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/pmtiles","role":"article","title":"PMTiles","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/PMTiles"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/FeatureStateVectorExample":{"kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"This example demonstrates feature state on a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource"},{"text":", toggling the appearance of countries in a vector tileset as they are tapped.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/featurestatevectorexample","role":"article","type":"topic","title":"Set Feature State (Vector Source)","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateVectorExample"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/WebAPIDataExample":{"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Showing data from an API with custom styling and interaction"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/webapidataexample","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/WebAPIDataExample","type":"topic","title":"Showing data from an API"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","type":"topic","title":"MapLibre"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNVectorTileSource":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnvectortilesource","title":"MLNVectorTileSource","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource"},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies tiled vector data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in "},{"type":"text","text":"Mapbox Vector Tile"},{"type":"text","text":" format"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to be shown on the map. The location of and metadata about the tiles are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"defined either by an option dictionary or by an external file that conforms to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"TileJSON specification"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A vector tile source is added to an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" object along with one or more","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" objects. A vector style layer defines the appearance of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"any content supplied by the vector tile source."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNVectorTileSource"}]}}}